19234.patch","merged_at":"2022-03-28T03:17:22Z"},"body":"There is a bug in the system webhooks whereby the active state is not checked when\r\nwebhooks are prepared and there is a bug that deactivating webhooks do not prevent\r\nqueued deliveries.\r\n\r\n* Only add SystemWebhooks to the prepareWebhooks list if they are active\r\n* At the time of delivery if the underlying webhook is not active mark it\r\nas \"delivered\" but with a failed delivery so it does not get delivered.\r\n\r\nFix #19220\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Andrew Thornton <art27@cantab.net>\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/19234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/19234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/comments/1079989330","html_url":"https://github.com/go-gitea/gitea/issues/19220#issuecomment-1079989330","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/go-gitea/gitea/issues/19220","id":1079989330,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBFIx285AX1RS","user":{"login":"zeripath","id":1824502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MjQ1MDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1824502?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath","html_url":"https://github.com/zeripath","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeripath/events{/privacy}","recei